  "description": "This ABSOLUT is equipped with high-end components to meet the needs of the most creative and demanding riders.\n• The MARZOCCHI Bomber DJ fork, favored by the world's best slopestyle riders, is designed to deliver exceptional performance. With its rigid 36mm stanchions and tapered steerer, it guarantees responsiveness and stability, providing the precision needed for perfectly controlled landings.\n• A BURGTEC cockpit includes the Enduro MK3 stem and the Ride High Alloy 38mm rise handlebar offer unmatched stability and control.\n• The rear brake is a SRAM Level T with 160mm rotor.\n• DT SWISS D1900 wheels are robust and responsive. Equipped with a single speed hub for optimal power transmission.",
